NOTE ON DATA — THE MIT LICENSE ABOVE COVERS THE SOURCE CODE.

All plot, planning, demographic, market, transaction, facility and portfolio
data bundled in src/data/ is representative or simulated for demonstration.
It is not an extract from Dubai Municipality, Dubai Land Department, RERA or
any other system, and it must not be relied upon for investment decisions.
Names of public bodies are used only to label the kind of source each
simulated record represents.

Optional basemap tiles are fetched at runtime under each provider's terms:
Esri World Imagery (Esri and its data providers) and CARTO dark basemap
(© OpenStreetMap contributors, © CARTO). The conversational assistant can call
the Claude API under Anthropic's terms when the operator supplies credentials.
